    23	 * Changelog
    24	 * 12.06.2012  Tim Ruehsen  created
    25	 *
    26	 *
    27	 * How to add a new command line option
    28	 * ====================================
    29	 * - extend wget_options.h/struct config with the needed variable
    30	 * - add a default value for your variable in the 'config' initializer if needed (in this file)
    31	 * - add the long option into 'options[]' (in this file). keep alphabetical order !
    32	 * - if appropriate, add a new parse function (examples see below)
    33	 * - extend the documentation (at docs/wget2.md)
    34	 *
    35	 * Set args to -1 if value for an option is optional.
    36	 */
